        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grampian%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits amid the Grampian Hills, five miles from Curwensville, and marks the end of the historic Tyrone & Clearfield Branch of the Pennsylvania Railroad.",
